{"resourceIdentifier":"2647","resourceName":"Reforestation grouped project Norteak Nicaragua","description":"Three Nicaraguan forestry projects have gone together to get access to carbon credits as a mean to expand the planted areas and strengthen environmental and social components. The carbon project will be managed by Norteak Nicaragua S.A., whose plantations are located in the\r\ndepartments of Boaco and Matagalpa and have a Forest Stewardship Council (FSC) certification issued\r\nin 2015. Ekoteak S.A. is a Swedish capital company that has worked hand in hand with Norteak Nicaragua\r\nS.A. in the exploitation and mechanized extraction of wood and whose plantations are in the Chinandega\r\ndepartment. Maderas Sostenibles S.A. (MSSA) is a Nicaraguan company formed in 2007 with the purpose\r\nof reforesting pasture lands in the Pacific Region of the country. Currently, MSSA manages a farm owned\r\nby Proyecto de Reforestación Limonapa S.A. in the Chinandega department, which is included as part of\r\nthe reforestation grouped project Norteak Nicaragua. Teak - Tectona grandis - is the central component in the first stage of the project, while local species are validated. Project activities are carried out and monitored according to approved project methodology AR-ACM0003\r\nfor a project period of 30 years. The project estimates to remove 6,357 tCO2e annually and 190,721 \r\ntCO2e during its entire life. The companies involved in the project have as an objective to achieve a group\r\ncarbon certification of its forest plantations recovering 709.2 hectares (ha) from degraded grasslands in\r\na total project zone of 3,545.5 ha. The project also generates net positive impacts on the social\r\nand economic well-being of the local communities who derive livelihoods from the project area, by\r\nproviding employment, facilitating the access to the social security benefits, including health care, and\r\nalso by executing trainings related to the forest management of the planting area.","location":{"latitude":12.613880,"longitude":-85.195710},"inPublicCommentPeriod":false,"lastPublicCommentPeriod":{"startInclusive":"2025-12-10","endExclusive":"2026-01-10","endInclusive":"2026-01-09"},"attributes":[{"code":"PROJECT_ID","values":[{"type":"string","value":"2647"}]},{"code":"STATE_PROVINCE","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Boaco, Matagalpa and Chinandega"}]}],"participationSummaries":[{"programCode":"VCS","attributes":[{"code":"PROPONENT_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Norteak Nicaragua S.A."},{"type":"string","value":"Managua, Nicaragua"},{"type":"string","value":"+505 87017693"},{"type":"string","value":"faurby@norteak.no"}]},{"code":"PROJECT_STATUS","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Registered"},{"type":"assetSearchLink","value":null,"targetId":"2647"},{"type":"bufferSearchLink","value":null,"targetId":"2647"}]},{"code":"EST_ANNUAL_EMISSION_REDCT","values":[{"type":"string","value":"6357"}]},{"code":"TOTAL_BUFFER_POOL_CREDITS","values":[{"type":"integer","value":5192}]},{"code":"PRIMARY_PROJECT_CATEGORY_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Agriculture Forestry and Other Land Use"}]},{"code":"PROJECT_SUBCATERGORY_NAMES","values":[{"type":"string","value":"ARR"}]},{"code":"PROTOCOL_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"AR-ACM0003"}]},{"code":"PROJECT_ACREAGE","values":[{"type":"string","value":"700 Hectares"}]},{"code":"VALIDATOR_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"AENOR CONFIA, S.A. (UNIPERSONAL)"}]},{"code":"PROJECT_REGISTRATION_DATE","values":[{"type":"string","value":"01/12/2022"}]},{"code":"CREDIT_PERIOD_INFO","values":[{"type":"string","value":"1st, 17/06/2016 - 16/06/2046"}]}]},{"programCode":"CCB","attributes":[{"code":"PROPONENT_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Norteak Nicaragua S.A."},{"type":"string","value":"Managua, Nicaragua"},{"type":"string","value":"+505 87017693"},{"type":"string","value":"faurby@norteak.no"}]},{"code":"PROJECT_STATUS","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Under Verif